          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" letterSpacing="1.1"><em><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false" letterSpacing="1.1">哈理工A.I.R.创新实验室</span></em></p>
