          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="36" fontFamily="锐字真言体免费商用" strikethrough="false" underline="false">04</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="560" height="36.25" topLeftX="110.86724409448817" topLeftY="33.10251968503937" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">写个函数，让舵机转到指定角度</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="124" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">① 接线与供电</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">信号线接定时器通道对应的引脚，舵机的电源要单独供，别从板子的 3.3V 上取电。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="194" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">② 角度换算封装成函数</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">把「角度换成脉宽」写进一个函数里，主程序里就只看得到角度，代码好读也好改。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="264" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">③ 上电先回中位</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">程序开头先给 90 度，再按需要转，避免上电瞬间猛地冲到限位撞坏齿轮。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="378" height="230" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="112" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(240, 240, 240, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <border color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" width="1" lineJoin="miter" miterLimit="10"/>
