      <shape width="354" height="212" topLeftX="522" topLeftY="120" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Consolas" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="no-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">void servo_set_angle(uint16_t angle)</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">{</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">  if (angle &gt; 180) angle = 180;</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">  uint16_t ccr = 500 + angle * 2000 / 180;</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(140, 70, 190, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">  __HAL_TIM_SET_COMPARE(&amp;htim1, TIM_CHANNEL_1, ccr);</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">}</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(86, 86, 86, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="Consolas" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">// 用法：servo_set_angle(90);</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="817.58" height="34" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="14" paddingRight="14" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">把角度换算写成函数，用舵机就和写 servo_set_angle(90) 一样简单。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note>
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">这一页是作业第三题的做法。函数里做了两件事：先把角度限制在 0 到 180 之间防止算错，再用比例公式换成脉宽写进 CCR。注意除法顺序，先乘后除能保留精度，整数运算里先除会丢小数。接线提醒一句：SG90 转动时会瞬间吃几百毫安电流，从板子的 3.3V 取电很容易把单片机拉复位，务必用单独的电源，并且把地线接在一起。第六周的考核有舵机角度控制这一项，所以这一页要动手跑通，不要只看代码。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
